    values:originalText "(b) notify a person or organisation; or  (c) provide information to a person or organisation; in relation to the enforcement or recovery of a fine imposed by the court, the law applies under subsection (1) in relation to the Federal Court of Australia and the Family Court of Australia in the same way as it applies to a court of the State or Territory." ;
